    "enUS": {
      "description": "\"Not so bad, eh? Since you're reading this, it means my stash is still there. Take a hundred paces due north and don't break your ankles going down the steep cliffside. There should be enough to keep you going.\"",
      "summary": "Find what awaits you.",
      "title": "Scramble",
